---
/**
 * The feed's own opener: both rail links in one row, in `RailHeading`'s
 * visual language. `RailHeading` itself renders one link per row, which
 * reads as two separate sections; a merged feed is one section, so this
 * carries both links side by side instead.
 */
---

<div
  class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border pb-2.5"
>
  <h2 class="text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-foreground/45 uppercase">
    Recent activity
  </h2>
  <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
    <a
      href="/activity/cycling"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-foreground/60 underline decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
    >
      All rides
      <span class="icon-[lucide--arrow-right] size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"
      ></span>
    </a>
    <a
      href="/activity/code"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-foreground/60 underline decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
    >
      All repos
      <span class="icon-[lucide--arrow-right] size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"
      ></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
